// Code signing settings. Copy this file to Signing.xcconfig and fill in your team ID.
//   cp Signing.example.xcconfig Signing.xcconfig
// To find your team ID, sign in under Xcode → Settings → Accounts, then run
//   security find-certificate -c "Apple Development" -p | openssl x509 -noout -subject
//   and take the 10 characters after OU= in the output.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
